                    {
                        "sense_id": "879263c1-ced1-3c38-a83a-b12bc107c7c6",
                        "entry_id": "bbb095c4-2f03-3f9b-8e56-9ddcd2740af5",
                        "glosses": [
                            "The light of evening; twilight."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "uncountable"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "902b724a-1e6d-41b2-b8e9-b3cf207d41e0",
                                "sense_id": "879263c1-ced1-3c38-a83a-b12bc107c7c6",
                                "text": "Here at the window in the evenlight I lean my ears to summon once again The sound of memory in its sweet refrain, [...]"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "845ecb60-f697-457d-8df8-4b0f19e71eba",
                                "sense_id": "879263c1-ced1-3c38-a83a-b12bc107c7c6",
                                "text": "The doings of Grendel, In far-off fatherland I fully did know of: Sea-farers tell us, this hall-building standeth, Excellent edifice, empty and useless To all the earlmen after evenlight's glimmer 'Neath heaven's bright hues [...]"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "6ac91fe7-dba5-4746-b9a6-d53dadd3cfc9",
                                "sense_id": "879263c1-ced1-3c38-a83a-b12bc107c7c6",
                                "text": "When a little child lies in your arms at night, What do you care for care; When her little lips sing in the evenlight, And her little arms clasp you there?"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "43b59f84-048b-48db-afe2-62314ce84b6d",
                                "sense_id": "879263c1-ced1-3c38-a83a-b12bc107c7c6",
                                "text": "Search further and the past presents you still New Ninas, new Alcamas, time's mid-night Concluding, — better say its evenlight Of yesterday."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
